# Design (always apply)

Visual source of truth: `src/shared/style/globals.css`. Change brand, color, type, space, or radius **there**. Dark mode is `.dark` in the same file. See `DESIGN.md`.

## Never hardcode

```
# BAD
<div className="bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-[14px]" />
style={{ color: "#2563eb", padding: 16 }}

# GOOD
<div className="bg-background rounded-lg text-foreground p-4 border-border" />
```

Form-builder styles stored on a layout document are operator-configured CSS — keep that path. Do not copy those hex values into dashboard chrome.

## Product UI

- Admin, driver, partner: **operate** — scanability and contrast beat decoration.
- Public wizard and embeddable forms: **convert** — clear steps, visible total, trustworthy pay box.

## Craft floor

- Visible `:focus-visible` ring. Never `outline-none` without a replacement.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Animate `opacity`/`transform` only. No `transition: all`.
- Hit targets ≥ 44px on mobile.
- Empty, loading (`…`), and error states are real UI.
- `ar` is RTL. Prefer logical CSS (`start`/`end`) over `left`/`right`.
- Copy: active voice. Errors say how to fix. Update all eight locale files together.
